{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36411","headline":"冬夕江上言事五首 四 · 罗邺","name":"冬夕江上言事五首 四","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"僻居多与懒相宜，吟拥寒炉过腊时。\n风柳欲生阳面叶，冻梅先绽岭头枝。\n山川自小抛耕钓，骨肉无因免别离。\n赖有陶情一尊酒，愁中相向展愁眉。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"罗邺","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_36411.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36411","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}